    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Furioso Dreadnought",
    "summary": "Whenever this model gets selected to fight, you may choose 1 enemy unit in Engagement Range of this model and roll a D6, with the result increased by 2 if a Charge move was made by this model this turn. A result of 4-5 inflicts D3 mortal wounds on that unit, and a 6+ inflicts 3 mortal wounds.",
